WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.805
Set ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL to the local GPROXY address, then export the
gateway key as ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN.

2
00:00:07.825 --> 00:00:12.962
This example uses a GPT model and sets its context window accordingly.

3
00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:20.492
Use the model option to select a gateway model or route, and send a
simple request in manual permission mode.

4
00:00:20.512 --> 00:00:25.900
This custom model produces an identification notice, followed by the
real reply.
